POTENTIAL IMPACTS

-----------------

 

  * POTENTIAL TSUNAMI IMPACTS ARE STILL BEING EVALUATED.

 

  * IF THERE IS A TSUNAMI THREAT TO GUAM... ROTA... TINIAN AND

    SAIPAN... THE EARLIEST IMPACTS WOULD BE AROUND 237 PM CHST

    ON WEDNESDAY JULY 30 2025.

 



PRELIMINARY EARTHQUAKE PARAMETERS - UPDATED

-------------------------------------------

 

  * MAGNITUDE      8.7

  * ORIGIN TIME    925 AM CHST JUL 30 2025

  * COORDINATES    52.2 NORTH  160.0 EAST

  * DEPTH          46 MILES

  * LOCATION       OFF THE EAST COAST OF KAMCHATKA  RUSSIA

 



NEXT UPDATE AND ADDITIONAL INFORMATION

--------------------------------------

 

  * THE NEXT MESSAGE WILL BE ISSUED IN ONE HOUR... OR SOONER IF

    THE SITUATION WARRANTS.

 

  * FURTHER INFORMATION ABOUT THIS EVENT MAY BE FOUND ON THE

    INTERNET AT WWW.TSUNAMI.GOV.

 

